807:- Formatting, TypeScript,496 rule tests (6102 assertions), production build and all ten affected native/mock browser cases pass (2.1minutes, no skips): source geometry, physical fractional scrolling, row spacing/states, outside-origin release, normal-release paint, capture loss, arrows/drag/keyboard/wheel, category reset/disabled controls, locked text/alpha, owned fixture cleanup, preview clipping, affordability/rejection and in-game editor cancellation. Final paint recapture cases also pass (31.8s). Native/mock active, disabled and locked captures were inspected; QA removes document-selection highlighting caused by its deliberately outside-origin press.
835:- `BubbleTanks3_fla.Symbol5_166` stops confirmation915 at frames1/12; `NoButton_167` and `yesButton_170` stop their child clips at11. The cache advances one retained tree through opening, freezes the open pose and resumes it for closing. Exported shape913 has even-odd cutouts under both buttons: the open button sample is white/alpha153, while hidden-button samples on the opening/closing morph background are alpha77.
867:- The new override rule and both device-font browser cases fail against the previous implementation. Formatting, TypeScript,513 rule/parser tests (6245 assertions), production build and the final nine native/mock browser cases pass (1.0minute, no skips). They verify paragraph line spacing, nowrap clipping/alignment, device fields avoiding SVG even with native assets, RGB/opacity, inline metric placement and primitive font declarations. Existing caption/cost font identity, clipping, accessibility/root cleanup, controls, manual saves and early confirmation remain verified. Both new captures were inspected.
