890:- Formatting, TypeScript,519 rule/parser tests (6,299 assertions), production build and all six native/mock component browser cases pass (23.3s, no skips). Focused tests fail against the archived component's author default and secondary-pointer paint. They also cover source field geometry, fresh/failed IDs, independent raw-code header decryption, preserved punctuation edits, invalid paste, limits/placeholder lifecycle, clipboard success/denial, focus return and visible screenshot pixels. Native/mock name and code captures were inspected. One earlier native load failed image decoding before dialog mount; the unchanged focused and full runs pass, with no loader/retry workaround or cause established.
